  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2019- 2024 Disaster Risk Management in the Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This&#xa0;five year&#xa0;partnership with the National Emergency Management Agency (NEMA)&#xa0;will primarily - provide a program of technical and advisory support to Cook Islands, Niue, Tokelau, Samoa and Tonga to strengthen&#xa0;domestic&#xa0;Disaster Risk Management (DRM) capabilities. Secondarily - deploy Emergency Managers&#xa0;to any requesting Pacific Island country impacted by a natural disasters, through&#xa0; the maintenance and strengthening of the Rapid Response Team (RRT).</narrative>
  </description>
